-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data files shipped with this repository

metrics/Rd.csv
  85 reflectance samples used by the Rd / CDM calculation path.
  Interpolated to 380–780 nm at 5 nm from Esposito Rd.xlsm hidden sheet
  RefData2 (original 360–750 nm / 10 nm; column order FM85, FM1, …, FM84).
  Provenance commonly cited for this table: X-Rite → Schmehling → Esposito.
  This file is NOT an official X-Rite or Esposito product.
  If you are a rights holder and object, please open a GitCode Issue.

metrics/Ob.csv
  Observer-related auxiliary table used by selected metrics.

metrics/GVI_samples.txt
  GVI sample reflectances used by metrics/GVI.py.

CIE colour-matching functions and illuminants are provided by LuxPy,
not copied into this repository as independent copyrighted tables.

